        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Jul 12, 2023",
            "id": "48a5e324-1285-4149-bf06-7b0286be302a",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for choosing “Harmony” Villa as your 30a vacation spot ! We were happy to host you & waiting to see you again !",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Our family had a great time at this beautifully appointed vacation home. The kids enjoyed the private pool everyday and my husband kayaked to the lake. We also brought our fishing poles and were able to catch (and release, of course) many types of fish and even a turtle! We took daily bike rides around the neighborhood and the public beach access was only a quick couple minutes drive. There was plenty of room for our group of 13 to spread out.\n\nThe owner was very responsive and helped us whenever we needed anything. Book your stay today!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Beautiful home and peaceful vacation",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Michele P.",
        "date": "2023-07-14T22:42:55Z",
        "id": "64b1cf6feff2097825290b00",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Jul 15, 2023",
            "id": "7f0fbcf2-bb27-4634-b838-4c1ba812f6ea",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much Michele & Family for choosing “Harmony” Villa as your 30a vacation spot ! We were happy to host you ! Our villa will be able next years from the beginning of June till September- come stay with us again ! We have also follow us on instagram @Harmony_30a and stay in touch )",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Our stay at this Vrbo was extraordinary. It’s even more beautiful in person. The large backyard pool provided hours of fun & relaxation for our large group. We found ourselves spending more time there than at the beach.\n\nWe also enjoyed the convenience offered by the close proximity to everything. With a diverse range of ages & interests among us, the easy access to the beach as well as restaurants & shops was a game-changer. Having access to 4 bikes with all the close ammenities added freedom & flexibility for the kids. It was so great that the parents could relax & they could go on their own adventures to get milkshakes & other treats. In addition to the bikes, we highly recommend taking advantage of the kayaks & paddle boards to venture through the waterways leading to Powell lake. It was a highlight of my trip.\n\nThe homeowners went above & beyond to ensure our stay was perfect. From their generosity in sending back a sentimental item that was accidentally left behind to allowing us to store our luggage in their garage during our delayed flight, their thoughtfulness was truly remarkable. \n\nThe Vrbo itself has everything you would want as well as the things you hadn’t thought of: a spacious kitchen with top of the line appliances, a covered patio overlooking the picturesque surroundings, comfortable beds, a convenient ice maker in the garage that we put to full use, & so much more. (The master bathroom was a personal favorite of mine.)\n\nBook. You won’t be disappointed.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "An Unforgettable 5-Star Retreat - Beyond Expectations!",
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
